        <rectangle id="part-2" width="412" height="242" font-size="16" fill="#f8fafc" stroke="#cbd5e1" title="Nested configuration&#10;Alarm Config -&gt; object&#10;Alarms: list&#10;Enabled: Boolean&#10;Auto Rollback Config -&gt; object&#10;Enabled: Boolean&#10;Events: list" />
